2. Summarize the transformation rule in words.

The transformation rule is: **"Gravity" - all non-zero values fall downward in their respective columns as far as they can go without overlapping other non-zero values. The values fall in order from top to bottom, with values from higher rows falling first and stacking from the bottom upward.**

More precisely:
