- Sort these values by their row position (top to bottom)
- Place these values in the column from bottom to top, in the same order they appeared from top to bottom
- Fill the remaining cells in the column with zeros

This means the bottommost row will contain the values that were originally at the bottom of the column, and values from higher rows will stack above them.

